The time delta data is gathered from a trivial nanosleep where one would
expect that the requested timespec data should in fact be the period of
time that happens with the nanosleep() call. However there is a delta of
what was requested and what was actually measured. I question the value
of this delta data : 

enceladus$ /usr/bin/nice -n +15 ./dispatch 8 44 2>&1 | grep '^DATA'
